  LocalProfileNotes: "LOCAL PLAYTEST PROFILE v1 \u2014 provisional, not final design
    decisions.\nManhattan ranges. Area 0/1: one tile; area N: radius N-1. Tile-fixed
    attacks may target darkness, damage enemies only. All units may overlap and pass.
    CD1: next turn; CD2: skip one turn.\nBurn: initial area hit plus once per zone
    per turn on entry/end of movement; lasts creation turn plus two. Stealth lasts
    through next turn. Root affects next turn. Kill AP is awarded once per enemy
    death immediately, capped at 25.\nRevive next turn at full HP inside own base
    vision; first revival cost 15, then -1 per turn to 10. No action after revival
    that turn.\nCraft during unlocked planning: one material, no AP/action; explicit
    replacement confirmation. Portal build includes start turn and activates two
    turns later; one-hop teleport; either endpoint destroyed removes both. Beacons
    persist.\nStarter roster is all five distinct characters. Equipment deck has
    five slots and may repeat the three defined items. Undefined upgrades/consumables
    and account progression are not fabricated.\nReady locks edits; both ready ends
    planning. Unassigned wait is free. Debug pause/reveal/force resolve are local
    testing controls. Unresolved combined defeats retain a draw."
